<title>USA: FFY Financial Corp completes shr buyback.</title>
<headline>FFY Financial Corp completes shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FFY Financial Corp said Friday it had completed its program to buy back about five percent of its outstanding shares, or 215,943 shares.     The</p>
<p>company said the shares were repurchased at an average price of $25.95 per share.</p>
<p>FFY Financial Corp is the holding company for First Federal Savings Bank of Youngstown, Ohio.</p>
